{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "description": "Golden decision vectors. Every PromptForge policy evaluator, in every language, must produce exactly these results. The TypeScript evaluator in packages/governance-pdp/src/evaluate.ts is the reference implementation; these vectors pin its behaviour so other implementations can be proven equivalent rather than assumed equivalent. Tool names are matched exactly: nothing parses a name, and tool_categories answers for nothing (hardening 1.5, 09-29-2026).",
  "scope": {
    "in": "The pure evaluate step: a verified bundle payload plus a PDP state in, a decision out.",
    "out": "Fetching, HS256 verification, caching and TTL/grace state derivation. Those are per-host concerns with their own tests. A host that has no bundle at all is also out of scope: report fail_closed and these vectors apply."
  },
